{"id":"0e949012fa0b2162","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy.md","title":"数类型归约与指称一致","display":"thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy — 数类型归约与指称一致","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy","aliases":["72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy"],"display":"thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy — 数类型归约与指称一致","depends_on":["[[72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer]]","[[72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness]]","[[72-df-system-t-denotation]]"],"chapter":"V","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.V §4.2, print358–359/PDF370–371; local adequacy corollary","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-system-t-numerical-adequacy — 数类型归约与指称一致"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"45a40cdcc24cf331\" href=\"?note=45a40cdcc24cf331\" title=\"72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer\">72-df-system-t-numerical-normalizer</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d8ac891559c0847\" href=\"?note=5d8ac891559c0847\" title=\"72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness\">72-lem-system-t-reduction-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9c9169e498db491f\" href=\"?note=9c9169e498db491f\" title=\"72-df-system-t-denotation\">72-df-system-t-denotation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"V"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.V §4.2, print358–359/PDF370–371; local adequacy corollary"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0}^c\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathcal T_{\\mathsf0}^c\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\mathcal E_H\">\\(\\eta\\in\\mathcal E_H\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=_T\">\\(=_T\\)</span> 为 β/recursor 归约生成的等式，不是全类型外延函数相等。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ t⟧_\\eta=\\operatorname{num}_T(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ t⟧_\\eta=\\operatorname{num}_T(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s=_Tt\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\operatorname{num}_T(s)=\\operatorname{num}_T(t)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad⟦ s⟧_\\eta=⟦ t⟧_\\eta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s=_Tt\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\operatorname{num}_T(s)=\\operatorname{num}_T(t)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad⟦ s⟧_\\eta=⟦ t⟧_\\eta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>t 归约到其唯一数码，归约可靠性和数码求值给第一式。生成等式保持指称，因而给数值相等；数值相等时两项归约到同一数码，反向连接两条有限链得到 =T。该完全对应仅对封闭数类型项成立；不由此推断高类型全集合模型中的外延相等必然等于计算等式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{